115號\n\n目前暫無公休日（休假日詳見FB粉專）\n午場11:30-14:30\n晚場16:30-20:30\n-\n更多拉麵分享\n#00吃拉麵\nIG：00eatramen",null,[0,58]]]],[null,1751986401000000,1751986401000000,"1 年前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfRVMtb21sUWJXV2RUTWNxZi1TcWtDZw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfRVMtb21sUWJXV2RUTWNxZi1TcWtDZxoTQ2d3STRlRzB3d1lReGR2MG1RTQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwil5e3ltteWAxVUZ_UHHfx7KYkQ_2MIpwEoEA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/16665007275069408389/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZQWVZONk5WaGxjMlZ0UjE5QlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16665007275069408389/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZQWVZONk5WaGxjMlZ0UjE5QlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/16665007275069408389/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZQWVZONk5WaGxjMlZ0UjE5QlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16665007275069408389/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZQWVZONk5WaGxjMlZ0UjE5QlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/16665007275069408389/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZQWVZONk5WaGxjMlZ0UjE5QlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16665007275069408389/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZQWVZONk5WaGxjMlZ0UjE5QlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["謝謝您這麼大力的支持\n非常感謝您的真心推薦❤️",null,[0,23]]]],[null,null,7410,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VPYVN6NVhlc2VtR19BRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x7ef58f600af02cd0!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEOaSz5XesemG_AE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VPYVN6NVhlc2VtR19BRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VPYVN6NVhlc2VtR19BRRIsChZDSUhNMG9nS0VPS0FsNE9UdEt5Zk9nEhJDZ3NJd2FpTndRWVFxSW5QSkEaLAoWQ0lITTBvZ0tFTld2bXRLOWxNU3lOQRISQ2dzSXhLYU53UVlRa09TZU9RIhIJAAAAAAAAAAAR0CzwCmCP9X4qCzBjN3BHMDNad0hj\u002